WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.740
Welcome back.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.500
You've scouted the talent.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.940
Now it's time to create the game plan.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.520
In sports, a season is won through consistent, structured approach.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.380
In leadership, the same is true.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:22.540
That system we call the 90-Day Way.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.020
It's our framework for turning intention into measurable impact.

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.506
In our next segment,

00:00:28.506 --> 00:00:33.260
you'll create your own 90-day plan to model the focus you expect

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.060
from your team.
